Bergamot translator glue
========================

frontend/src/assets/bergamot/bergamot-translator.js is the Emscripten glue
for Bergamot / Firefox Translations, generated from
https://github.com/mozilla/translations (v0.6.0+eea6e5a8) and vendored from
https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox/tree/main/toolkit/components/translations/bergamot-translator

It is Mozilla Public License 2.0. The license text is in LICENSE next to
this notice.

The WASM engine and the Firefox Translations model files are not stored in
this repository. The app downloads them from Mozilla's Firefox Remote
Settings attachment CDN:

https://firefox-settings-attachments.cdn.mozilla.net/

- translations-wasm, bergamot-translator version 3.0 (release v0.6.0), MPL-2.0
- translations-models-v2, base-memory version 3.0, MPL-2.0

See the project README for checksums and the language pairs.
